        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginAnim": "AniZhuanchangEnd",
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Medic",
            "Remember the question you asked me...? \"Should we humans embrace our destiny of destruction?\""
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 107,
        "ActionId": 108,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Medic",
            "I thought about it for a long time."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 108,
        "ActionId": 109,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Medic",
            "I am just as lost as you, with no place to go back to, and do not know where to go either. I'm just drifting about in the doomsday."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 109,
        "ActionId": 110,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Medic",
            "But when I was looking at the stars tonight, I suddenly understood..."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 110,
        "ActionId": 111,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Medic",
            "...Humanity was bred from such destruction."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 111,
        "ActionId": 112,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Medic",
            "We are all unique. No matter how hard life treats you, you will have your own way to shine."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 112,
        "ActionId": 113,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Medic",
            "There is always hope, as long as we are alive."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 113,
        "ActionId": 114,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "EndAnim": "AniZhuanchangBegin",
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Medic",
            "So my answer is, please try your best to live every day to the fullest. I may not have a home to go back to, but other soldiers still do... The things and people they love are still waiting for them."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 114,
        "ActionId": 115,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 101,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
